\pard\sa180\qc\b\fs36\f0 Dental Clinic Management System\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 \par
\pard\sa140\b\fs28\f0 1. Project Summary\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 \par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 This project is a role-based Dental Clinic Management System (DCMS) built with Laravel, Inertia.js, and React. It supports four major user roles:\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 \par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - `admin`\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - `staff`\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - `dentist`\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - `patient`\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 \par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 The system combines:\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 \par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - a public-facing landing page\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - authenticated portal access\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - appointment booking and scheduling\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - patient registration and verification\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - treatment history and file attachments\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - notifications and reminders\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - reports and exports\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - system configuration and backup management\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - audit logging for traceability\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 \par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 At a high level, Laravel handles routing, validation, business logic, persistence, exports, mail, and jobs, while React pages render the user interface through Inertia.\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 \par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 \par
