\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 \par
\pard\sa140\b\fs28\f0 3. Application Architecture\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 \par
\pard\sa140\b\fs28\f0 3.1 Request/response model\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 \par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 1. Browser sends a request to Laravel.\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 2. Route middleware checks authentication and role.\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 3. Controller validates input and runs business logic.\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 4. Eloquent reads/writes domain models.\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 5. Controller returns either:\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 - an Inertia page with props\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 - a redirect with flash messages\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 - a JSON response for async UI calls\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 - a file download for exports/backups\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 6. Shared Inertia middleware injects auth, flash, and unread notification count.\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 \par
\pard\sa140\b\fs28\f0 3.2 Main layers\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 \par
\pard\sa120\b\fs24\f0 Presentation layer\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 \par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - React pages under `resources/js/Pages`\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - role-specific layouts under `resources/js/Layouts`\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - reusable UI components under `resources/js/Components`\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 \par
\pard\sa120\b\fs24\f0 Application layer\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 \par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - controllers under `app/Http/Controllers`\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - middleware for auth/role gating\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - support classes for availability, reporting, settings defaults\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 \par
\pard\sa120\b\fs24\f0 Domain/data layer\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 \par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - Eloquent models under `app/Models`\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - migrations under `database/migrations`\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - database-backed notifications, audit logs, settings, appointments, patients, treatments\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 \par
\pard\sa120\b\fs24\f0 Async/integration layer\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 \par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - mailables under `app/Mail`\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - queued jobs under `app/Jobs`\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - `AppointmentObserver` dispatches reminder/confirmation jobs\par
