\pard\sa140\b\fs28\f0 5. Role Responsibilities\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 \par
\pard\sa60\fs18\f1 Role    Main responsibilities\par
\pard\sa60\fs18\f1 Admin    Manage users, view reports, review audit data, configure clinic settings, handle backup/restore, create appointments\par
\pard\sa60\fs18\f1 Staff    Register patients, verify landing inquiries, manage appointments, send reminders, handle check-ins, monitor notifications\par
