\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 - includes specialization and schedule days\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - `Appointment`\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 - links patient and dentist\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 - stores date, time, type, notes, status\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - `TreatmentRecord`\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 - clinical record for a patient visit\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 - linked to dentist, patient, and optionally appointment\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - `TreatmentRecordAttachment`\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 - x-rays or procedure photos for treatment records\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - `Notification`\par
