\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 - patient-requested change for sensitive fields\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - `UserSetting`\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 - per-user notification/UI preferences\par
\pard\li360\sa60\fs22\f0 - `SystemSetting`\par
\pard\sa120\fs22\f0 - clinic-wide config values\par
